{
  "_readme": [
    "The default shipped scene (M12 step 5a): the Merrimack estuary in the one world frame, from",
    "the north jetty tip -- what `gagame --sea` has always meant. Every value is the legacy flag's",
    "default, so a scene that says nothing means what the flags meant; scenes/recipes/*.json are",
    "this file with a few keys overridden, each carrying the flag line that made it in _recipe.",
    "Sections, keys and units: src/scene/SceneSchema.h. Overlays (stronger than this file):",
    "scenes/views/builtin.json (the kept views) and data/wave_scene.json (the M8 water scene, at",
    "`water`; authored if absent, never clobbered). Resolution: defaults < this file < includes",
    "< --set, objects by key, named arrays by name, placements replaced whole (SceneBuilder.h)."
  ],
  "scene": {"name": "merrimack", "mode": "world", "planet": "earth", "view": "sea"},
  "include": [
    {"file": "scenes/views/builtin.json", "at": "", "optional": false},
    {"file": "data/wave_scene.json", "at": "water", "optional": true}
  ],
  "place": {"anchor": [-70.81, 42.81833]},
