    "edits": "data/gis/edits.geojson",
    "_atlas": "ONE ATLAS (2026-10-21, Mark: \"Data sets should never be specific to place, only the measurement type\"): every dataset here is a measurement's global set -- the water composite of data/composite/fidelity/world.gafid (bed, tides, currents, sea state, river gauges), the planet's buildings, roads and bridges -- and every scene that inherits this one flies the same world. A scene chooses a place (place.anchor, views, the solver's box, the wave field's window); it names no data of its own."
  },
